---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../../lib/url';
---

<Layout title="Mission" description="The aims of SanVitoRomano Lovers: making San Vito Romano and its surrounding area better known, above all online, and fostering communication so that tourism and cultural activities succeed.">
  <h1>Mission</h1>
  <p class="meta">Why SanVitoRomano Lovers exists and what we work on.</p>

  <p>
    SanVitoRomano Lovers is a community of people with a bond to San Vito Romano, who want to make
    it better known and to support those who keep it alive. Our work has the following aims.
  </p>

  <ol class="mission-list">
    <li>
      <h2>
        Making San Vito Romano and its surrounding area better known, above all through online
        strategies (web and social media)
      </h2>
      <p>
        We tell the web what makes San Vito Romano unique: its history and legends, its places,
        trails, traditions and events. We want those who live here to rediscover it, and those who
        don't know it yet to feel like coming to visit.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2>Fostering communication so that tourism and cultural activities succeed</h2>
      <p>
        We promote and ease communication between residents, associations, local businesses and
        visitors, so that the village's tourism and cultural initiatives are known, well attended
        and successful.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p>
    Would you like to get involved or tell us about an initiative? <a href={withBase('en/contatti/')}>Get in touch</a>.
  </p>

  <style>
    .mission-list {
      margin: 2rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 720px;
    }
    .mission-list li::marker {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    }
    .mission-list h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .mission-list p {
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
